@startuml
 title SplitSmart Architecture 1 - approved modular monolith (ADR-001)
package "Phase 1 desktop deployment" {
  [Swing views / presenters] as desktop
  [HTTP DTOs / client adapter] as transport
  desktop --> transport
}
package "Single shared backend deployment - Java 21 / Maven" {
  [HTTP / security adapters] as http
  [Application use cases / ports] as app
  [Domain rules / BigDecimal] as domain
  [JDBC transaction adapters] as jdbc
  [SMTP adapter] as mail
  http --> app
  app --> domain
  jdbc ..> app : implements persistence ports
  http --> jdbc : transaction composition
  mail ..> app : implements mail port
}
database "Shared PostgreSQL\nledger, balances, private receipts,\nnotifications and business records" as db
cloud "SMTP / development mail sink" as smtp
transport --> http : HTTPS / API v1
jdbc --> db
mail --> smtp
package "Required future clients" {
  [Primary web client] as web
  [Android app] as android
  [iOS app] as ios
}
web ..> http : future consumer
android ..> http : future consumer
ios ..> http : future consumer
note bottom of domain
No Swing, SQL or HTTP types.
Business services are in-process responsibilities.
Approval, ledger and balances share one transaction.
end note
note bottom of web
PLAN-001 phases delivery only.
Swing does not satisfy FR-012.
Future client toolchains/support matrices need review.
end note
@enduml
